{"id":"b8aff5a145","t":"The Rebel of the Apocalypse Academy","c":"cv","n":21,"l":21,"s":["mg","ml"],"k":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy"},"u":1795419491204,"desc":"بعد وفاة والديه، يعيش كاناتا وشقيقته في ملجأ للموهوبين، ويبتكر في الثامنة عشرة جهازًا للسفر عبر الأبعاد، لكن مدير الأكاديمية الذي يجلّه يخونه. فيقفز في بوابة انتقال ويستيقظ في عالم تملؤه الوحوش، وبعد نجاته ووصوله إلى أكاديمية تجمع طلابًا من أبعاد مختلفة، يُفاجأ بوجود الرجل الذي خانه! فهل سيتمكن من بلوغ قمة القوة والانتقام ممن غدروا به؟ اقرأ مانهوا The Rebel of the Apocalypse Academy مترجمة بالكامل بأعلى جودة على مانجا تايم (MangaTime). تابع أحدث الفصول الحصرية فور نزولها على موقعنا.","type":"مانجا","status":"مستمر","genres":["أكشن","إثارة","خارق للطبيعة","فنون قتالية","مغامرة"],"src":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy"},"chapters":{"1":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy/1/"},"2":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy/2/"},"3":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy/3/"},"4":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy/4/"},"5":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy/5/"},"6":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy/6/"},"7":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy/7/"},"8":{"mg":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|","ml":"the-rebel-of-the-apocalypse-academy|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-apo